{"id":"19.5","doc":"T","title":"DMA-AES Working Mode","words":188,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In the DMA-"},{"t":"block","v":"AES","id":"crypto"},{"t":"text","v":" working mode, the AES accelerator supports six block cipher modes including ECB/CBC/OFB/CTR/CFB8/CFB128."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can choose the block cipher mode by configuring the "},{"t":"reg","v":"AES_BLOCK_MODE_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" register according to Table 19.5-1 below."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 19.5-1. Block Cipher Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"AES_BLOCK_MODE_REG[2:0]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Block Cipher Mode"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ECB (Electronic Codebook)"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CBC (Cipher Block Chaining)"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"OFB (Output Feedback)"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CTR (Counter)"}]]},{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CFB8 ("},{"t":"num","v":"8-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" Cipher Feedback)"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"5"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CFB128 ("},{"t":"num","v":"128-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" Cipher Feedback)"}]]},{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"6"}],[{"t":"text","v":"reserved"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"7"}],[{"t":"text","v":"reserved"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can check the working status of the AES accelerator by inquiring the "},{"t":"reg","v":"AES_STATE_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" register and comparing the return value against the Table 19.5-2 below."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 19.5-2. Working Status under DMA-AES Working mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"AES_STATE_REG[1:0]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Status"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Description"}]],"rows":[{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"IDLE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"The AES accelerator is idle."}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"WORK"}],[{"t":"text","v":"The AES accelerator is in the middle of an operation."}]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"DONE"}],[{"t":"text","v":"The AES accelerator completed operations."}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When working in the DMA-AES working mode, the AES accelerator supports interrupt on the completion of computation."}]},{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"To enable this function, write 1 to the "},{"t":"reg","v":"AES_INT_ENA_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" register."}]},{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"By default, the interrupt function is disabled."}]},{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Also, note that the interrupt should be cleared by software after use."}]}]}]}